# Production Deployment Guide - Ventics AI

## 🚀 Business-Grade Deployment Checklist

This guide ensures your Ventics AI platform is production-ready, secure, and scalable for enterprise use.

---

## 📋 Pre-Deployment Checklist

### ✅ **1. Security Configuration**

#### Backend Security
- [ ] **Change JWT_SECRET_KEY** - Generate strong 64+ character secret
  ```bash
  # Generate secure secret
  python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(64))"
  ```
- [ ] **Set PAYSTACK_WEBHOOK_SECRET** - Required for payment verification
- [ ] **Update ALLOWED_ORIGINS** - Add production domain(s)
- [ ] **Enable EMAIL_VERIFICATION** - Set `REQUIRE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION=true`
- [ ] **Rotate API Keys** - All third-party service keys (Stability AI, OpenAI, Gemini, etc.)
- [ ] **Database Credentials** - Use strong passwords, not defaults
- [ ] **Redis Password** - Secure Redis instance

#### Frontend Security
- [ ] **Environment Variables** - Never commit [.env.local](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-website-master/.env.local) to git
- [ ] **API Keys** - Only use `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` for client-safe values
- [ ] **Google OAuth** - Configure production redirect URIs
- [ ] **Remove Debug Logs** - Clean up console.log statements

---

### ✅ **2. Environment Configuration**

#### Backend [.env](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/.env) (Production)
```bash
# Application
ENVIRONMENT=production
APP_NAME=Ventics AI API
VERSION=1.0.0

# Security
JWT_SECRET_KEY=<GENERATE_64_CHAR_SECRET>
JWT_ALGORITHM=HS256
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=60
REQUIRE_EMAIL_VERIFICATION=true

# CORS - Add your production domain
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=https://yourdomain.com,https://www.yourdomain.com

# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/ventics_ai_prod
DIRECT_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/ventics_ai_prod

# Paystack (Production Keys)
PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_YOUR_LIVE_SECRET_KEY
PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=pk_live_YOUR_LIVE_PUBLIC_KEY
PAYSTACK_WEBHOOK_SECRET=<YOUR_WEBHOOK_SECRET>

# Email Service (Choose one)
# Option 1: SMTP
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USERNAME=your-email@gmail.com
SMTP_PASSWORD=your-app-password
SMTP_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@yourdomain.com

# Option 2: Mailgun (Recommended for production)
MAILGUN_API_KEY=<YOUR_MAILGUN_KEY>
MAILGUN_DOMAIN=mg.yourdomain.com
MAILGUN_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@yourdomain.com

# AI Services
STABILITY_API_KEY=<YOUR_KEY>
OPENAI_API_KEY=<YOUR_KEY>
GEMINI_API_KEY=<YOUR_KEY>
REPLICATE_API_TOKEN=<YOUR_KEY>

# Storage (S3)
S3_BUCKET=ventics-ai-production
S3_REGION=us-east-1
S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=<YOUR_KEY>
S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=<YOUR_SECRET>
CLOUDFRONT_DOMAIN=cdn.yourdomain.com

# Redis (Production)
REDIS_HOST=your-redis-host.com
REDIS_PASSWORD=<STRONG_PASSWORD>
REDIS_PORT=6379

# Rate Limiting
RATE_LIMIT_ENABLED=true
```

#### Frontend [.env.local](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-website-master/.env.local) (Production)
```bash
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_API_URL=https://api.yourdomain.com/v1
NEXT_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=<YOUR_PRODUCTION_CLIENT_ID>
NEXT_PUBLIC_ENVIRONMENT=production

# Analytics (Optional)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FB_PIXEL_ID=<YOUR_PIXEL_ID>
NEXT_PUBLIC_FB_ACCESS_TOKEN=<YOUR_TOKEN>
```

---

### ✅ **3. Database Setup**

#### Run Migrations
```bash
cd ventics-ai-api-master

# Generate Prisma client
npx prisma generate

# Run migrations
npx prisma migrate deploy

# Verify database
npx prisma db push
```

#### Create Indexes (Performance)
```sql
-- Already in schema.prisma, but verify they exist:
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_user_email ON "User"(email);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_generation_user ON "Generation"(user_id);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_project_user ON "Project"(user_id);
```

#### Backup Strategy
- [ ] Set up automated daily backups
- [ ] Test restore procedure
- [ ] Store backups in separate location

---

### ✅ **4. Payment Integration**

#### Paystack Production Setup
1. **Switch to Live Keys**
   - Get live keys from Paystack Dashboard
   - Update `PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY` and `PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY`

2. **Configure Webhooks**
   ```
   Webhook URL: https://api.yourdomain.com/v1/payments/webhook
   Events to subscribe:
   - charge.success
   - subscription.create
   - subscription.disable
   ```

3. **Test Payments**
   - [ ] Test successful payment
   - [ ] Test failed payment
   - [ ] Test webhook delivery
   - [ ] Verify credit allocation

---

### ✅ **5. Deployment Steps**

#### Backend Deployment (Recommended: Railway/Render/DigitalOcean)

**Option A: Railway**
```bash
# Install Railway CLI
npm install -g @railway/cli

# Login
railway login

# Initialize project
railway init

# Add environment variables
railway variables set JWT_SECRET_KEY=<your-secret>
# ... add all other variables

# Deploy
railway up
```

**Option B: Docker**
```dockerfile
# Create Dockerfile in ventics-ai-api-master/
FROM python:3.12-slim

WORKDIR /app

COPY requirements.txt .
RUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt

COPY . .

EXPOSE 8000

CMD ["uvicorn", "app.main:app", "--host", "0.0.0.0", "--port", "8000"]
```

```bash
# Build and run
docker build -t ventics-ai-api .
docker run -p 8000:8000 --env-file .env ventics-ai-api
```

#### Frontend Deployment (Recommended: Vercel)

```bash
# Install Vercel CLI
npm install -g vercel

# Deploy
cd ventics-ai-website-master
vercel

# Add environment variables in Vercel dashboard
# Set production environment variables
```

---

### ✅ **6. Domain & SSL**

- [ ] **Purchase Domain** - yourdomain.com
- [ ] **Configure DNS**
  - `A` record: `@` → Backend IP
  - `CNAME` record: `www` → yourdomain.com
  - `CNAME` record: `api` → backend-host.com
- [ ] **SSL Certificates** - Let's Encrypt (automatic with Vercel/Railway)
- [ ] **Update CORS** - Add production domains to `ALLOWED_ORIGINS`

---

### ✅ **7. Monitoring & Logging**

#### Error Tracking
```bash
# Install Sentry (Recommended)
pip install sentry-sdk

# Add to app/main.py
import sentry_sdk
sentry_sdk.init(
    dsn="<YOUR_SENTRY_DSN>",
    environment="production",
    traces_sample_rate=1.0,
)
```

