## 🔒 Security Best Practices

### Critical Security Measures
1. **Never commit secrets** - Use [.gitignore](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/.gitignore) for [.env](file:///c:/Users/Main/Downloads/ventics-ai-api-master/.env) files
2. **Rotate credentials** - Change all default passwords
3. **Enable 2FA** - On all admin accounts
4. **Regular updates** - Keep dependencies updated
5. **Security audits** - Regular penetration testing
6. **Rate limiting** - Already implemented, verify it's enabled
7. **Input validation** - Already implemented via Pydantic
8. **SQL injection protection** - Prisma ORM handles this
9. **XSS protection** - Next.js handles this
10. **HTTPS only** - Enforce SSL in production

